        <body>
            <div xml:id="d25-a2">

                <pb facs="0051" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg44"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 25.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Braida to General Lacayo.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Since the receipt of your communication of
                    the 24th instant in regard to a provisional council having been established, I
                    have repeatedly requested the representative of the other high contracting
                    party, Vice-Consul E. Hatch, to inform me whether this council was formed in
                    compliance with the compact made between your excellency and Her Britannic
                    Majesty’s Consul Bingham.</p>
                <p>Having been informed by Vice-Consul Hatch this morning that he, in behalf of his
                    Government, considers said council formed according to the agreement, I have the
                    honor of thanking you for your kind information.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. C. Braida.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
